weakspot.general.combodisplayenabled.tooltip=[Client] Show your hit streak (combo) on screen.\nCounted like the hit sound's scale: it breaks after about 2 seconds without a hit. Shown from 2.
weakspot.general.comboscale.tooltip=[Client] Size multiplier of the combo number.
weakspot.general.comboposition.tooltip=[Client] Where to show the combo.\nBELOW_CROSSHAIR, RIGHT_OF_CROSSHAIR, TOP_CENTER (below boss bars)
weakspot.general.combomilestoneeffects.tooltip=[Client] Accent sound and glow when the combo reaches 10, 25, 50, 100, 250, 500 and 1000 (then every 1000).\nThe higher the step, the bigger the show (fireworks from 500, a title from 1000).
weakspot.combo.machine=Machine %sx speed
weakspot.combo.kind=%s ×%s
weakspot.combo.shots=Shots ×%s
weakspot.combo.title=%s COMBO!
weakspot.growth.dark=Too dark to grow (light %s, needs 9 or more). Light it up with torches (outdoors gets dark at night, too).
weakspot.growth.stuck=No growth after %s hits. Check its surroundings (water, light, space, soil).
weakspot.general.blockhealthbarenabled.tooltip=[Client] Show the remaining health of the block you are mining as a green bar along the bottom margin of its face.\nOnly for blocks you mine by holding left click that can have a weak spot.
weakspot.general.machineparticlesvisible.tooltip=[Client] Show the colored particles around boosted machines on your screen.\nTurns off the particles of your machines and of other players' machines alike.
weakspot.general.weakspottrailenabled.tooltip=[Client] Animate weak spots as they move: the marker quickly slides to its new place, leaving a short trail.\nVisual only: hits count at the new place immediately. Off switches in place. Also applies to other players' markers.

key.weakspot.toggle=Toggle All Weak Spots
weakspot.toggle.on=Weak Spots (all): On
weakspot.toggle.off=Weak Spots (all): Off
weakspot.toggle.offReminder=Weak Spots (all): Off (press %s to toggle)
weakspot.general.otherscombodisplay.tooltip=[Client] Show nearby players' combos (10 or more) above their heads as "n HIT".
weakspot.general.machinebarenabled.tooltip=[Client] Show progress (yellow) and fuel (orange) bars above furnaces, brewing stands and spawners.\nOnly while their machine weak spot is shown (sneak and hold right click with empty hands).
weakspot.general.growthbarenabled.tooltip=[Client] Show a yellow growth bar at the foot of a crop while its weak spot is shown.\nOnly while you hold right click with an empty hand on it.
weakspot.general.othermarkershape.tooltip=[Client] Shape of other players' weak spot markers.\nCIRCLE (filled), RING (hollow), DIAMOND, SQUARE. Your own marker stays a filled circle.
weakspot.general.weakspotsenabled.tooltip=[Client] Turn your own weak spots on or off (the Toggle Weak Spots key switches it).\nWhile off, your weak spots do not appear and the game plays as usual. Other players' markers are still shown.
weakspot.general.animalspotseethrough.tooltip=[Client] When your weak spot on an animal or enemy is hidden by its body, show the hidden part faintly through it.\nHelps when the body is bigger than the hitbox, such as chickens or zombie arms. Other players' markers are not shown through.
weakspot.general.bowdrawbarenabled.tooltip=[Client] While drawing a bow, show how far it is drawn as a gauge below the crosshair.\nShown regardless of the bow weak spot and of turning weak spots off (HOME key).
weakspot.general.vehicleboostbarenabled.tooltip=[Client] Show the remaining boost time (light blue) above the crosshair while your vehicle is boosted.

